sequenceDiagram
    participant UserA
    participant BrowserA
    participant App
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant RT as Realtime
    participant BrowserB
    UserA->>BrowserA: Update shared budget
    BrowserA->>App: Submit mutation
    App->>DB: Persist change
    DB-->>RT: Change event
    RT-->>BrowserB: Realtime payload
    BrowserB->>BrowserB: Patch or invalidate cache